    "name": "Dreamscape Runners",
    "steam_appid": 2292080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292080/extras/acad2393b18f8cdbade9ae8e871b4184.avif?t=1675114610\" /></span><br>Zoom through short fast-paced chaotic levels filled with branching paths, and various obstacles to get to the end! Use various power-ups to either transverse the level quicker or in a different way - some of which can be used to slow the other player or to get rid of enemies. Go up against a friend in local co-op or play against yourself to get a new high score! Prove yourself to be the best dreamscape runner!<br><br>Features:<br><br>- 6 fast-paced chaotic levels to race through.<br>- Find and use 6 different unique power-ups to change the flow of the race.<br>- Local 2-Player Multiplayer (Player 1 uses keyboard and mouse, while player 2 uses controller)<br>- Best times on each level",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292080/extras/acad2393b18f8cdbade9ae8e871b4184.avif?t=1675114610\" /></span><br>Zoom through short fast-paced chaotic levels filled with branching paths, and various obstacles to get to the end! Use various power-ups to either transverse the level quicker or in a different way - some of which can be used to slow the other player or to get rid of enemies. Go up against a friend in local co-op or play against yourself to get a new high score! Prove yourself to be the best dreamscape runner!<br><br>Features:<br><br>- 6 fast-paced chaotic levels to race through.<br>- Find and use 6 different unique power-ups to change the flow of the race.<br>- Local 2-Player Multiplayer (Player 1 uses keyboard and mouse, while player 2 uses controller)<br>- Best times on each level",
    "short_description": "Chaotic fast-paced racing game that can be played solo or with a friend locally! Use various power ups to reach (or open up!) other paths - or use them to mess with your friend.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
